alized_name": "强制帧率"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_size"}, "name": "force_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "强制尺寸"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_width"}, "name": "custom_width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "custom_width"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_height"}, "name": "custom_height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "custom_height"}, {"widget": {"name": "frame_load_cap"}, "name": "frame_load_cap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "帧数读取上限"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_first_frames"}, "name": "skip_first_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "跳过前X帧"}, {"widget": {"name": "select_every_nth"}, "name": "select_every_nth", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "模选"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "shape": 7, "name": "format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "format"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "VHS_LoadVideo", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_LoadVideo"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["型号：选择您的 DiT 型号\n\n3B 型号：速度更快，显存需求更低\n- seedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\n- seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensorsFP8 8位（高质量）\n- seedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\n- seedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.ggufGGUF 8 位量化（高质量）\n\n7B 型号：画质更高，显存需求更高\n- seedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\n- seedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors：FP8，最后一个数据块使用FP16，以减少伪影（质量良好）\n- seedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\n- seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_*：锐化版本，增强细节\n\n设备：用于 DiT 推理的 GPU 设备（例如，cuda:0）\n\noffload_device：当 DiT 模型不处于活跃处理状态时，用于卸载 DiT 模型的设备\n- none：将模型保存在推理设备（速度最快、显存最大的设备）上\n- cpu：卸载到系统内存（减少显存）\n- cuda:X：将负载转移到另一块GPU（如果可用，则可获得良好的负载均衡）\n\ncache_model：在工作流运行之间，保持卸载设备上的 DiT 模型加载状态\n- 适用于批量处理，避免重复加载\n- 需要设置 offload_device\n\nblocks_to_swap：块交换内存优化\n- 0：已禁用（默认）\n- 1-32：需要替换为 3B 型号的变压器模块数量\n- 1-36：需要更换为 7B 型号的变压器模块数量\n- 数值越高，节省的显存越多，但处理速度越慢。\n- 需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\n\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n- 结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n- 需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\n\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n- sdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\n- flash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\n\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n\nBlockSwap详解：\nBlockSwap 允许在显存有限的 GPU 上运行大型模型，它在推理过程中动态地在 GPU 和 CPU 内存之间交换 Transformer 模块。其工作原理如下：\n\n- 它的作用：仅将当前需要的转换器模块保留在 GPU 上，而将其余模块存储在 CPU 或其他设备上。\n- 何时使用：在放大阶段出现 OOM（内存不足）错误时\n- 如何配置：\n设置offload_device为cpu或其他 GPU\n先从blocks_to_swap=16（一半的积木）开始\n如果仍然出现内存不足的情况，请增加到 24 或 32 (3B) / 36 (7B)。\n启用此功能swap_io_components可最大程度节省显存\n如果显存充足，可以降低或设置为 0 以加快处理速度。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [713.5144653320312, 896.7373657226562], "pos": [835.0924682617188, 1248.0506591796875], "id": 38, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-13.54447242721304, -415.7731824703574], "scale": 1.0610764609500047}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "无RH会员右键保存预览", "bounding": [2128.16455078125, 808.9273071289062, 416.58203125, 1125.002197265625]}], "links": [[17, 17, 3, 19, 0, "VHS_VIDEOINFO"], [18, 17, 2, 18, 1, "AUDIO"], [46, 34, 0, 36, 1, "block_swap_config"], [47, 35, 0, 36, 2, "extra_args"], [48, 36, 0, 24, 0, "*"], [50, 17, 0, 36, 0, "IMAGE"], [52, 24, 0, 18, 0, "IMAGE"], [55, 19, 0, 18, 4, "FLOAT"], [56, 24, 0, 39, 0, "IMAGE"], [57, 17, 2, 39, 1, "AUDIO"], [58, 19, 0, 39, 4, "FLOAT"]], "id": "187703c2-a75d-4daf-8396-9ae247608125", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 39, "revision": 0}